#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:78
#, xml-text
msgid "Requests Dependencies"
msgstr "Dependências do Requests"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Exigidas"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:82
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"charset-normalizer\"/>, <xref linkend=\"idna\"/>, and <xref "
"linkend=\"urllib3\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"charset-normalizer\"/>, <xref linkend=\"idna\"/> e <xref "
"linkend=\"urllib3\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:87
#, xml-text
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Recomendadas"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:89
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"make-ca\"/>, with <xref linkend=\"p11-kit\"/> (both needed "
"to use system https: certificates, removing an unnecessary dependency on the"
" <application>Certifi</application> module)."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"make-ca\"/>, com <xref linkend=\"p11-kit\"/> (ambos "
"necessários para usar os certificados &quot;https:&quot; do sistema, "
"removendo uma dependência desnecessária relativa ao módulo "
"&quot;<application>Certifi</application>&quot;)."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:95
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Opcionais"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:97
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"https://pypi.org/project/PySocks/\">PySocks</ulink> (also "
"needed for testing)"
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"https://pypi.org/project/PySocks/\">PySocks</ulink> (também "
"necessário para testagem)"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:100
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional (for testing)"
msgstr "Opcionais (para testagem)"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"pytest\"/>, <ulink url=\"https://pypi.org/project/pytest-"
"mock/\">pytest-mock</ulink>, <ulink url=\"https://pypi.org/project/pytest-"
"httpbin/\">pytest-httpbin</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://pypi.org/project/pytest-cov/\">pytest-cov</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://pypi.org/project/pytest-xdist/\">pytest-xdist</ulink>, and "
"<ulink url=\"https://pypi.org/project/trustme/\">trustme</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"pytest\"/>, <ulink url=\"https://pypi.org/project/pytest-"
"mock/\">pytest-mock</ulink>, <ulink url=\"https://pypi.org/project/pytest-"
"httpbin/\">pytest-httpbin</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://pypi.org/project/pytest-cov/\">pytest-cov</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://pypi.org/project/pytest-xdist/\">pytest-xdist</ulink> e <ulink"
" url=\"https://pypi.org/project/trustme/\">trustme</ulink>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Requests"
msgstr "Instalação do Requests"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:116
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First apply a patch so that the same environment variable already used to "
"point to system certificates in <application>Python3</application> following"
" the installation of <application>make-ca</application> can also be used by "
"this module:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro aplique um remendo, de forma que a mesma variável de ambiente já "
"usada para apontar para certificados de sistema em "
"&quot;<application>Python3</application>&quot;, seguindo a instalação de "
"&quot;<application>make-ca</application>&quot;, também possa ser usada por "
"esse módulo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:122
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../requests-use_system_certs-2.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../requests-use_system_certs-2.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:124
#, xml-text
msgid "Build the module:"
msgstr "Construa o módulo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:132
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>&install-wheel; requests</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>&install-wheel; requests</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Assuming <xref linkend=\"pytest\"/> is installed, but the other optional "
"dependencies are not, the installation can be tested with the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Supondo que <xref linkend=\"pytest\"/> esteja instalado, mas as outras "
"dependências opcionais não estejam, a instalação pode ser testada com os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:142
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Some of the setup instructions below may indicate an error due to dependent "
"module versions, but these errors do not affect the test results."
msgstr ""
"Algumas das instruções de configuração abaixo possivelmente indiquem um erro"
" devido a versões dependentes de módulos, mas esses erros não afetam os "
"resultados do teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:148
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>python3 -m venv --system-site-packages testenv &amp;&amp;\n"
"source testenv/bin/activate                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"pip3 install pytest-mock    \\\n"
"             pytest-httpbin \\\n"
"             pytest-cov     \\\n"
"             pytest-xdist   \\\n"
"             pysocks        \\\n"
"             trustme                           &amp;&amp;\n"
"python3 /usr/bin/pytest tests\n"
"deactivate</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>python3 -m venv --system-site-packages testenv &amp;&amp;\n"
"source testenv/bin/activate                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"pip3 install pytest-mock    \\\n"
"             pytest-httpbin \\\n"
"             pytest-cov     \\\n"
"             pytest-xdist   \\\n"
"             pysocks        \\\n"
"             trustme                           &amp;&amp;\n"
"python3 /usr/bin/pytest tests\n"
"deactivate</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/requests.xml:161
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"See <xref linkend=\"make-ca\"/> for how to set the environment variable, and"
" for how local copies of the Certifi and Requests modules installed in a "
"virtual environment <emphasis>will</emphasis> override the system "
"certificates."
msgstr ""
"Veja-se &quot;<xref linkend=\"make-ca\"/>&quot; para saber como configurar a"
" variável de ambiente e como as cópias locais dos módulos "
"&quot;Certifi&quot; e &quot;Requests&quot; instaladas em um ambiente virtual"
" <emphasis>substituirão</emphasis> os certificados do sistema."

